## 5. Derived files in `scripts/build/`

These are intermediates. Safe to delete; they regenerate.

| File | Produced by | Contains |
|---|---|---|
| `paras.json` | `extract.py` | every paragraph of the source .docx with size/bold/centre flags |
| `book.json` | `model.py` | the canonical book structure (chapters, blocks, front/back matter) |
| `prompts.json` | build | the per-chapter reflection prompts used on notes pages |
| `pagenos.json` | `paginate.py` | opener name → final page number (feeds the TOC) |
| `inserts.json` | `paginate.py` | where blanks were inserted (feeds the epigraph pages) |

Note the name collision: `scripts/book.json` is the **KDP config**;
`scripts/build/book.json` is the **manuscript structure**. Different files.

