## 8. Verify before handing anything back

```bash
python3 build/verify.py dist/.../INTERIOR.pdf --expect-trim {TRIM_CODE} --expect-even --expect-pages {PAGES}
python3 build/verify.py dist/.../COVER_hardcover.pdf --expect-size {HC_SIZE}
python3 build/verify.py dist/.../COVER_paperback.pdf --expect-size {PB_SIZE}
epubcheck dist/.../Book.epub          # require 0 errors AND 0 warnings
```

Then **render pages to images and look at them.** Title page, contents, a chapter
opener, a body spread, the back matter, and both cover proofs. Structural checks
passing is not the same as the book being right — most of the bugs in §7 pass
every automated check.

```python
import pypdfium2 as pdfium
d = pdfium.PdfDocument("interior.pdf")
d[14].render(scale=1.5).to_pil().save("/tmp/p15.png")
```

